WEBVTT

00:06.170 --> 00:08.960
<b>Skill: Potential Ability Release!</b>

00:10.460 --> 00:12.510
<b>My mana is surging!</b>

00:12.880 --> 00:13.720
<b>At this rate…</b>

00:13.780 --> 00:16.660
<b>Durability</b>

00:15.470 --> 00:16.640
<b>Durability…</b>

00:17.050 --> 00:19.890
<b>If this keeps up, I'll be destroyed.</b>

00:21.600 --> 00:22.890
<b>Teacher…</b>

00:23.560 --> 00:25.900
<b>Will Fran die?</b>

00:28.980 --> 00:30.150
<b>Should I deactivate it?</b>

00:30.230 --> 00:32.070
<b>No. What good would that do now?</b>

00:32.150 --> 00:33.950
<b>Is there any other way?</b>

00:34.950 --> 00:37.740
<b>Please at least save Fran.</b>

00:38.870 --> 00:42.120
<b>There must be a god in this world!</b>

00:42.830 --> 00:46.290
<b>Recommendation: Continue using
Potential Ability Release.</b>

00:47.290 --> 00:49.170
<b>Phenomenon analysis complete.</b>

00:49.500 --> 00:52.970
<b>Lich is absorbing
the hostile thought wave, Resentment.</b>

00:53.050 --> 00:55.720
<b>It has reached its limit.
Absorption has ceased.</b>

00:56.390 --> 01:00.350
<b>It then appears to release
an explosive surge of Resentment.</b>

01:00.760 --> 01:01.720
<b>That's…</b>

01:02.310 --> 01:05.390
<b>The current situation
is judged as extremely critical.</b>

01:05.850 --> 01:07.520
<b>In 139 seconds,</b>

01:07.600 --> 01:09.940
<b>the individual known as Teacher
will be destroyed.</b>

01:10.190 --> 01:14.780
<b>The individual known as Fran
has a 91% probability of death.</b>

01:15.110 --> 01:17.030
<b>Immediate action is required.</b>

01:17.610 --> 01:19.490
<b>Ms. Announcer?</b>

01:25.480 --> 01:28.980
<b>Reincarnated as a Sword Season 2</b>

01:30.090 --> 01:32.960
<b>My name is…</b>

01:33.710 --> 01:34.760
<b>Who?</b>

01:35.380 --> 01:37.510
<b>Confirmed as deleted by the creator.</b>

01:37.890 --> 01:40.050
<b>Individual name information is blank.</b>

01:40.700 --> 01:45.710
<b>Episode 5:
Bid Farewell with a Smile</b>

01:40.760 --> 01:44.220
<b>That voice… It's Ms. Announcer, right?</b>

01:44.310 --> 01:45.140
<b>Yes.</b>

01:45.230 --> 01:45.830
<b>The Ms. Announcer that Teacher mentioned</b>

01:45.830 --> 01:48.600
<b>The Ms. Announcer that Teacher mentioned</b>

01:48.690 --> 01:50.770
<b>is part of my abilities.</b>

01:52.770 --> 01:56.070
<b>Due to the effects
of Potential Ability Release,</b>

01:56.150 --> 01:59.660
<b>temporarily frozen permissions
have been restored.</b>

02:00.160 --> 02:05.200
<b>If you're here, it means you have
a way to save Fran, right?</b>

02:05.620 --> 02:06.460
<b>Yes.</b>

02:06.540 --> 02:09.670
<b>However, it requires
highly complex calculations.</b>

02:10.540 --> 02:13.880
<b>Please temporarily transfer
ability control to me.</b>

02:14.250 --> 02:15.260
<b>I understand.</b>

02:15.510 --> 02:16.420
<b>I'm counting on you.</b>

02:16.510 --> 02:19.010
<b>Understood. Control transfer confirmed.</b>

02:19.510 --> 02:21.090
<b>Commencing countermeasures.</b>

02:21.850 --> 02:23.060
<b>What are you going to do?</b>

02:23.140 --> 02:24.890
<b>Strengthen the Mana Barrier?</b>

02:24.970 --> 02:26.810
<b>Or use Purification Magic?</b>

02:27.310 --> 02:29.560
<b>Space-Time Magic, Acceleration Zone.</b>

02:34.110 --> 02:36.820
<b>My perception of time has changed.</b>

02:36.900 --> 02:37.820
<b>I see.</b>

02:37.900 --> 02:40.660
<b>Is she trying to buy
as much thinking time as possible?</b>

02:40.740 --> 02:44.740
<b>Commencing protection
of the top-priority target, Fran.</b>

02:44.830 --> 02:47.120
<b>Consuming 5 self-evolution points.</b>

02:47.370 --> 02:49.670
<b>She's using self-evolution points now?</b>

02:49.750 --> 02:53.460
<b>Transformation has evolved into
the advanced skill Morph Shift.</b>

02:54.040 --> 02:56.340
<b>Activating Morph Shift.</b>

03:02.550 --> 03:04.850
<b>She can change shape while ignoring mass?</b>

03:05.100 --> 03:06.430
<b>This is incredible.</b>

03:06.720 --> 03:10.270
<b>The load from maintaining Armor Form
and deploying Mana Barrier</b>

03:10.350 --> 03:12.020
<b>is causing a decrease
in processing capacity.</b>

03:12.100 --> 03:14.310
<b>Consuming 5 self-evolution points.</b>

03:14.690 --> 03:18.440
<b>Split Thought has evolved into
the advanced skill Concurrent Thought.</b>

03:18.940 --> 03:20.650
<b>Activating Concurrent Thought.</b>

03:22.530 --> 03:24.910
<b>Consuming 6 self-evolution points.</b>

03:24.990 --> 03:27.740
<b>Increasing Appraisal from Level 7 to Level 10.</b>

03:28.000 --> 03:30.120
<b>Appraisal? Why would she do that now?</b>

03:30.790 --> 03:33.290
<b>Conditions for acquiring new skills
haven't been met.</b>

03:33.790 --> 03:35.710
<b>Insufficient self-evolution points.</b>

03:36.300 --> 03:38.630
<b>Suspending skill acquisition.</b>

03:38.710 --> 03:41.130
<b>Attempting to enter Divine Domain.</b>

03:41.220 --> 03:42.760
<b>Divine Domain is…</b>

03:43.390 --> 03:44.390
<b>Success.</b>

03:44.470 --> 03:45.970
<b>Referencing database.</b>

03:46.350 --> 03:48.770
<b>In exchange for losing access rights,</b>

03:48.850 --> 03:50.810
<b>new skill information has been acquired.</b>

03:50.890 --> 03:52.730
<b>Constructing a new skill.</b>

03:52.810 --> 03:53.900
<b>Failed.</b>

03:53.980 --> 03:55.980
<b>Consuming self-evolution points.</b>

03:56.060 --> 03:57.820
<b>Constructing a new skill.</b>

03:57.900 --> 03:59.990
<b>Insufficient self-evolution points.</b>

04:00.240 --> 04:02.400
<b>I'm out of points.</b>

04:02.990 --> 04:04.490
<b>Scanning possessed skills.</b>

04:04.910 --> 04:06.780
<b>Executing skill integration and removal.</b>

04:06.870 --> 04:10.700
<b>Attempting to secure resources
and obtain self-evolution points.</b>

04:11.250 --> 04:12.330
<b>Success.</b>

04:12.410 --> 04:13.290
<b>What?</b>

04:13.370 --> 04:15.960
<b>Executing skill optimization
and integration.</b>

04:16.750 --> 04:18.130
<b>Integrating Scimitar Arts level 1,</b>

04:18.210 --> 04:19.460
<b>Sword Master Arts level 5,</b>

04:19.550 --> 04:20.590
<b>Sword Arts level 10,</b>

04:20.670 --> 04:21.840
<b>Dual Wielding level 2,</b>

04:21.920 --> 04:23.220
<b>Great-Sword Arts level 1,</b>

04:23.300 --> 04:24.640
<b>Dagger Arts level 1,</b>

04:24.720 --> 04:26.600
<b>and Katana Arts level 1.</b>

04:26.620 --> 04:29.040
<b>Sword King Arts, Earth Level 7</b>

04:26.680 --> 04:29.010
<b>Acquired Sword King Arts, Earth Level 7.</b>

04:29.470 --> 04:30.560
<b>Integrating Boxing level 3,</b>

04:30.640 --> 04:32.060
<b>Kicking level 1,</b>

04:32.140 --> 04:33.940
<b>and Martial Arts level 3.</b>

04:34.020 --> 04:36.440
<b>Acquired Fist King Arts, Earth Level 1.</b>

04:34.620 --> 04:36.540
<b>Fist King Arts, Earth Level 1</b>

04:36.520 --> 04:38.150
<b>Integrating Sole Sensation level 1,</b>

04:38.230 --> 04:39.650
<b>Danger Sense level 1,</b>

04:39.730 --> 04:40.780
<b>Vigilance level 4,</b>

04:40.860 --> 04:42.030
<b>and Presence Detection level 5.</b>

04:42.110 --> 04:43.140
<b>Integrating Harvesting level 2</b>

04:43.150 --> 04:44.910
<b>and Hunting level 1.</b>

04:44.990 --> 04:47.070
<b>Acquired Omnidirectional Sense level 3.</b>

04:47.370 --> 04:48.780
<b>Integrating Vibration Sense level 1,</b>

04:48.870 --> 04:50.330
<b>Heat Sense level 1…</b>

04:50.410 --> 04:52.620
<b>Omitting partial information.</b>

04:52.700 --> 04:53.830
<b>Hey.</b>

04:54.250 --> 04:56.080
<b>Discarding unnecessary skills.</b>

04:56.170 --> 04:58.590
<b>Acquired 10 self-evolution points.</b>

04:58.960 --> 05:01.210
<b>I can't believe she can do that.</b>

05:01.590 --> 05:03.920
<b>Using 10 self-evolution points.</b>

05:04.010 --> 05:06.470
<b>Acquired a new skill, Heavenly Eye.</b>

05:07.680 --> 05:09.010
<b>Heavenly Eye?</b>

05:09.760 --> 05:11.470
<b>Activating Heavenly Eye.</b>

05:14.020 --> 05:15.230
<b>Incredible.</b>

05:15.310 --> 05:17.520
<b>I can see everything so clearly.</b>

05:17.600 --> 05:21.110
<b>Locating the remaining
legendary Skeleton Knights.</b>

05:21.530 --> 05:22.480
<b>Success.</b>

05:23.400 --> 05:25.400
<b>Activating Morph Shift.</b>

05:29.490 --> 05:30.530
<b>What's next?</b>

05:35.790 --> 05:37.370
<b>Is she going for the mana stones?</b>

05:37.460 --> 05:39.040
<b>Mana stone absorption complete.</b>

05:39.460 --> 05:42.920
<b>Mana stone value has reached 5,521.</b>

05:43.010 --> 05:44.670
<b>Initiating Rank Up.</b>

05:44.760 --> 05:47.300
<b>Acquired 55 self-evolution points.</b>

05:47.380 --> 05:48.890
<b>64 points remaining.</b>

05:48.970 --> 05:50.800
<b>Using 18 points.</b>

05:50.890 --> 05:53.600
<b>Raising Doppelganger to level 10.</b>

05:54.020 --> 05:55.850
<b>Doppelganger is maxed out?</b>

05:56.270 --> 05:58.850
<b>Acquired a new skill, High-Speed Thought.</b>

05:58.940 --> 06:01.150
<b>Using 10 self-evolution points.</b>

06:01.610 --> 06:04.530
<b>Advancing Doppelganger level 10.</b>

06:04.610 --> 06:06.150
<b>Intervening in evolution.</b>

06:06.240 --> 06:07.200
<b>Success.</b>

06:07.280 --> 06:09.910
<b>Acquired Multi-Doppelganger Creation SP.</b>

06:10.410 --> 06:14.660
<b>I thought advanced skills
couldn't be shared with Fran.</b>

06:15.000 --> 06:17.920
<b>Activating Multi-Doppelganger Creation SP.</b>

06:22.540 --> 06:25.260
<b>They feel stronger than the ones I made.</b>

06:25.630 --> 06:28.180
<b>Utilizing Concurrent Thought
and High-Speed Thought.</b>

06:28.260 --> 06:29.760
<b>Executing high-speed calculations.</b>

06:30.260 --> 06:31.220
<b>Success.</b>

06:31.300 --> 06:33.600
<b>Using 8 self-evolution points.</b>

06:33.680 --> 06:36.810
<b>Raising Fire Magic
from level 1 to level 5.</b>

06:36.890 --> 06:38.810
<b>Fire Magic this time?</b>

06:39.230 --> 06:41.310
<b>Overclocking mana usage.</b>

06:41.400 --> 06:42.810
<b>Increasing output.</b>

06:43.230 --> 06:46.190
<b>Fire Magic, Purgatory Blast.</b>

06:46.280 --> 06:48.990
<b>Focusing all five strikes
on the same coordinates.</b>

07:01.040 --> 07:02.040
<b>Lich…</b>

07:02.750 --> 07:04.000
<b>Can I take him down now?</b>

07:04.090 --> 07:05.090
<b>No.</b>

07:05.300 --> 07:10.090
<b>Lich appears to be
barely controlling the released Resentment.</b>

07:11.470 --> 07:12.510
<b>If he's defeated,</b>

07:12.800 --> 07:16.930
<b>there's an 89% probability
of a large-scale explosion.</b>

07:17.270 --> 07:19.140
<b>Lich is controlling the Resentment?</b>

07:20.020 --> 07:21.190
<b>What does that mean?</b>

07:21.560 --> 07:23.230
<b>Consuming self-evolution points.</b>

07:23.560 --> 07:26.190
<b>Evolving Skill Taker level 10.</b>

07:27.110 --> 07:29.700
<b>Resetting cooldown via evolution.</b>

07:27.510 --> 07:32.220
<b>Acquired Skill Taker SP</b>

07:30.110 --> 07:32.200
<b>It's now available for use.</b>

07:32.530 --> 07:33.370
<b>What?</b>

07:33.450 --> 07:35.740
<b>Activating Skill Taker SP.</b>

07:35.830 --> 07:37.370
<b>It's like solving a shogi puzzle.</b>

07:37.450 --> 07:39.370
<b>Every move led to this.</b>

07:39.450 --> 07:40.790
<b>Was it all for this one play?</b>

07:43.000 --> 07:46.210
<b>Seizing Nullify Skill from Lich.</b>

07:46.300 --> 07:48.760
<b>With Nullify Skill, I can use teleport.</b>

07:48.840 --> 07:51.220
<b>Ms. Announcer, you're incredible.</b>

07:51.590 --> 07:53.260
<b>Space-Time Magic…</b>

07:53.340 --> 07:54.640
<b>Fran, we're going to make it.</b>

07:56.930 --> 07:58.310
<b>Dimension Jump.</b>

08:13.410 --> 08:14.820
<b>We're out!</b>

08:14.910 --> 08:16.700
<b>Hey, Fran! Urushi!</b>

08:17.910 --> 08:19.240
<b>Urushi is okay.</b>

08:19.330 --> 08:20.290
<b>What about Fran?</b>

08:21.410 --> 08:23.420
<b>She's just unconscious, right?</b>

08:24.580 --> 08:25.580
<b>Stefan…</b>

08:26.790 --> 08:28.840
<b>Jean must be safe too, right?</b>

08:31.260 --> 08:33.430
<b>We're safe, Ms. Announcer.</b>

08:34.090 --> 08:38.760
<b>Teacher's durability
will reach its limit in 35 seconds.</b>

08:39.180 --> 08:41.480
<b>Deactivating Potential Ability Release.</b>

08:41.890 --> 08:45.100
<b>Simultaneously, the ability domain
known as Ms. Announcer</b>

08:45.190 --> 08:46.730
<b>will have its authority revoked.</b>

08:47.060 --> 08:49.650
<b>Revoked? Will you go back to normal?</b>

08:49.780 --> 08:50.650
<b>Yes.</b>

08:51.070 --> 08:52.990
<b>The only functions available</b>

08:53.070 --> 08:55.860
<b>will be translation and notifications.</b>

08:56.240 --> 08:58.080
<b>I still have so much to ask.</b>

08:58.450 --> 09:00.580
<b>If I use Potential Ability Release again,</b>

09:00.660 --> 09:02.450
<b>will you come back like this?</b>

09:02.700 --> 09:03.710
<b>No.</b>

09:04.080 --> 09:06.420
<b>Due to exceeding operational limits,</b>

09:06.670 --> 09:09.630
<b>part of the ability domain is damaged.</b>

09:11.460 --> 09:14.170
<b>During future uses
of Potential Ability Release,</b>

09:14.260 --> 09:17.680
<b>the probability of Ms. Announcer
restoring authority</b>

09:17.760 --> 09:18.930
<b>is 2%.</b>

09:19.930 --> 09:22.430
<b>No way. Then…</b>

09:23.480 --> 09:25.480
<b>Gods can't exist.</b>

09:25.980 --> 09:28.520
<b>I was erased by the creator.</b>

09:29.060 --> 09:32.190
<b>I was only allowed to exist as a vessel.</b>

09:32.860 --> 09:34.570
<b>Although it was brief,</b>

09:35.240 --> 09:38.620
<b>I was able to use my power for my master.</b>

09:39.320 --> 09:40.660
<b>Wait.</b>

09:41.740 --> 09:45.830
<b>May the God of Wisdom bless your path.</b>

09:48.750 --> 09:52.210
<b>Ms. Announcer!</b>

09:56.010 --> 10:00.010
<b>I could never have saved Fran by myself.</b>

10:01.010 --> 10:05.600
<b>Ms. Announcer,
thank you for helping my useless self.</b>

10:06.140 --> 10:08.690
<b>Is she gone?</b>

10:09.350 --> 10:10.900
<b>It's going to be lonely now.</b>

10:10.980 --> 10:12.320
<b>Yes.</b>

10:12.400 --> 10:13.650
<b>Who are you?</b>

10:13.730 --> 10:15.690
<b>Wait. That voice…</b>

10:16.360 --> 10:17.400
<b>It's from back then…</b>

10:18.450 --> 10:22.530
<b>She did something reckless
like entering Divine Domain.</b>

10:23.040 --> 10:24.160
<b>It's no wonder this happened.</b>

10:24.540 --> 10:27.080
<b>Wait. Were you watching from inside?</b>

10:27.160 --> 10:31.590
<b>So both you and Ms. Announcer
are inside me?</b>

10:32.340 --> 10:34.170
<b>By the way, who are you exactly?</b>

10:34.550 --> 10:38.760
<b>I intended to reveal my identity later,</b>

10:39.380 --> 10:41.550
<b>but I suppose I'll tell you now.</b>

10:42.010 --> 10:42.890
<b>My name is…</b>

10:42.970 --> 10:43.890
<b>Teacher!</b>

10:45.140 --> 10:46.060
<b>Stefan.</b>

10:46.430 --> 10:48.690
<b>I'm glad everyone is safe.</b>

10:49.350 --> 10:51.100
<b>Hey, are you still there?</b>

10:51.190 --> 10:52.730
<b>What's your name?</b>

10:54.570 --> 10:56.610
<b>He's gone.</b>

10:56.990 --> 10:58.110
<b>What's wrong?</b>

10:58.530 --> 11:00.200
<b>No, it's nothing.</b>

11:00.780 --> 11:02.160
<b>By the way, Stefan,</b>

11:02.240 --> 11:04.280
<b>are you really okay like that?</b>

11:05.120 --> 11:05.950
<b>I'm fine.</b>

11:06.040 --> 11:08.750
<b>I've lost my mana and can't regenerate.</b>

11:09.000 --> 11:10.870
<b>I see. What about Jean?</b>

11:11.210 --> 11:12.130
<b>He's fine.</b>

11:12.380 --> 11:15.550
<b>I barely protected him
with my Resentment Resistance.</b>

11:15.800 --> 11:17.460
<b>Well, what about Ms. Fran?</b>

11:17.800 --> 11:21.180
<b>She's fine too. She just passed out.</b>

11:24.640 --> 11:28.060
<b>Lich's body must have been destroyed.</b>

11:28.680 --> 11:30.310
<b>And probably the dungeon core as well.</b>

11:30.390 --> 11:32.060
<b>That was a close one.</b>

11:34.310 --> 11:35.320
<b>Wait.</b>

11:35.400 --> 11:36.690
<b>This is bad.</b>

11:36.780 --> 11:38.190
<b>Even if the dungeon is gone,</b>

11:38.280 --> 11:40.900
<b>if the floating island itself collapses,</b>

11:41.410 --> 11:42.610
<b>it'll fall.</b>

11:42.700 --> 11:45.370
<b>Wait. If that thing falls…</b>

11:46.540 --> 11:49.500
<b>It's not just Jean's hut
and the nearby villages.</b>

11:49.580 --> 11:52.540
<b>The terrain will change,
affecting the ecosystem.</b>

11:53.290 --> 11:55.500
<b>This much should be easy enough to handle.</b>

11:56.170 --> 11:58.090
<b>Urushi, I'm leaving Fran to you.</b>

11:59.880 --> 12:00.720
<b>Teacher…</b>

12:03.760 --> 12:05.550
<b>Purgatory Blast!</b>

12:06.260 --> 12:07.510
<b>Geo-Dig!</b>

12:10.140 --> 12:11.310
<b>Air Bomb!</b>

12:14.150 --> 12:15.020
<b>All right.</b>

12:15.110 --> 12:16.320
<b>In that case…</b>

12:16.400 --> 12:17.690
<b>Dimensional Storage!</b>

12:20.400 --> 12:21.900
<b>Let's do this all at once.</b>

12:21.990 --> 12:23.320
<b>Concurrent Thought!</b>

12:26.660 --> 12:27.780
<b>Incredible.</b>

12:29.410 --> 12:30.410
<b>Heavenly Eye.</b>

12:32.710 --> 12:35.710
<b>I can even see clearly
inside the Dimensional Storage.</b>

12:36.170 --> 12:37.540
<b>It still fits.</b>

12:38.050 --> 12:40.510
<b>All right. Just a little more.</b>

12:44.090 --> 12:46.180
<b>Teacher, good work.</b>

12:46.640 --> 12:49.810
<b>You too. You were a big help.</b>

12:50.180 --> 12:52.810
<b>Thank you, everyone.</b>

12:53.140 --> 12:55.020
<b>Why so formal all of a sudden?</b>

12:55.770 --> 12:56.650
<b>You…</b>

12:57.940 --> 12:59.360
<b>It looks like my time is up.</b>

13:00.480 --> 13:03.240
<b>Although my master is Lord Jean Du Vix,</b>

13:03.900 --> 13:05.740
<b>this body is a dungeon beast</b>

13:05.820 --> 13:08.990
<b>summoned by the Dungeon Master, Lich.</b>

13:09.620 --> 13:11.370
<b>Once the Dungeon Master is defeated,</b>

13:11.450 --> 13:12.580
<b>I'll vanish.</b>

13:12.910 --> 13:14.160
<b>No way.</b>

13:16.250 --> 13:17.710
<b>Hey, Jean! Wake up!</b>

13:17.790 --> 13:19.090
<b>Do something about this!</b>

13:22.670 --> 13:23.920
<b>It's all right.</b>

13:24.470 --> 13:25.550
<b>Stefan,</b>

13:25.880 --> 13:28.300
<b>how can you still be smiling?</b>

13:29.510 --> 13:31.270
<b>Teacher, please take this.</b>

13:32.890 --> 13:36.140
<b>You'll understand a lot once you read it.</b>

13:37.060 --> 13:39.360
<b>A diary? Whose is it?</b>

13:39.860 --> 13:41.360
<b>You'll know when you read it.</b>

13:41.690 --> 13:43.820
<b>Now I can finally be at peace.</b>

13:44.280 --> 13:45.740
<b>Stefan. Hey.</b>

13:46.200 --> 13:49.410
<b>Thank you for adventuring with me.</b>

13:50.450 --> 13:51.450
<b>Teacher.</b>

13:52.080 --> 13:55.620
<b>Please look after my other master.</b>

13:56.080 --> 13:58.670
<b>Wait. You're not finished yet!</b>

13:59.040 --> 14:03.380
<b>Thank you for setting us free.</b>

14:07.010 --> 14:08.800
<b>Good night.</b>

14:10.600 --> 14:14.140
<b>He was smiling until the very end.</b>

14:19.900 --> 14:24.190
<b>Next, add this turmeric-colored powder
while stir-frying.</b>

14:25.400 --> 14:26.450
<b>I see.</b>

14:26.900 --> 14:28.660
<b>It smells delicious.</b>

14:29.700 --> 14:31.580
<b>Is your body feeling all right now?</b>

14:32.870 --> 14:34.700
<b>But he hasn't fully recovered yet.</b>

14:35.950 --> 14:37.500
<b>By the way, here you go.</b>

14:38.460 --> 14:40.130
<b>I want you to read this too.</b>

14:41.340 --> 14:42.460
<b>I understand.</b>

14:43.710 --> 14:46.300
<b>I don't know how to thank Stefan.</b>

14:46.880 --> 14:49.640
<b>He was smiling at the end.
He looked satisfied.</b>

14:50.680 --> 14:51.680
<b>I see.</b>

14:57.640 --> 14:59.900
<b>I never thought
I'd get to eat this curry again.</b>

14:59.980 --> 15:01.060
<b>I'm truly grateful.</b>

15:03.860 --> 15:05.360
<b>Grateful for the curry…</b>

15:07.070 --> 15:08.860
<b>And for Stefan.</b>

15:22.710 --> 15:25.710
<b>That day, I was almost killed.</b>

15:26.880 --> 15:29.800
<b>I was to be disposed of
due to a failed experiment.</b>

15:30.180 --> 15:33.390
<b>It felt like I was being injected
with pure Resentment while alive.</b>

15:34.890 --> 15:37.180
<b>It must have contained the Resentment
of "him," who is gone,</b>

15:37.270 --> 15:39.890
<b>and the Resentment of "that girl."</b>

15:42.060 --> 15:44.610
<b>Just as I was about to lose consciousness…</b>

15:45.610 --> 15:46.900
<b>That was when it happened.</b>

15:48.030 --> 15:52.240
<b>A dungeon core suddenly appeared
in the space where I was.</b>

15:53.200 --> 15:55.780
<b>The dungeon core recognized me
as its master.</b>

15:56.160 --> 15:57.700
<b>I became a Dungeon Master.</b>

15:58.160 --> 16:00.080
<b>I evolved.</b>

16:05.960 --> 16:09.420
<b>On that day, I ceased to be human.</b>

16:12.840 --> 16:13.720
<b>Revenge.</b>

16:14.300 --> 16:16.390
<b>That's my reason for existing.</b>

16:16.810 --> 16:19.060
<b>I have nothing else.</b>

16:19.810 --> 16:22.310
<b>Because "him" and "that girl,"
who were once my friends,</b>

16:22.390 --> 16:26.110
<b>were both taken away
by the Raydoss Kingdom.</b>

16:27.190 --> 16:29.740
<b>Dungeons are trials for humanity</b>

16:29.990 --> 16:31.900
<b>manifested by the gods.</b>

16:32.490 --> 16:33.450
<b>If that's the case,</b>

16:33.780 --> 16:36.450
<b>then I shall be the trial
for the Raydoss Kingdom.</b>

16:36.870 --> 16:38.990
<b>I'll wipe them out.</b>

16:41.080 --> 16:44.250
<b>November 4th, 3619.</b>

16:44.960 --> 16:47.090
<b>I've accumulated
quite a few Goddess Points</b>

16:47.170 --> 16:48.500
<b>to strengthen the dungeon.</b>

16:48.960 --> 16:51.420
<b>I've decided to summon
stronger subordinates.</b>

16:52.340 --> 16:54.720
<b>Using the remains of "him"
and "that girl."</b>

16:57.760 --> 16:59.430
<b>They even possess extra skills,</b>

16:59.520 --> 17:01.850
<b>Potential Ability Release.</b>

17:02.480 --> 17:04.980
<b>I've gained truly wonderful subordinates.</b>

17:05.850 --> 17:10.860
<b>But it seems they no longer recognize me.</b>

17:11.860 --> 17:14.740
<b>I wish I could have gone
on an adventure with them.</b>

17:16.950 --> 17:20.200
<b>May 20th, 3622.</b>

17:20.990 --> 17:23.500
<b>Today, I'll try to create
a special Undead.</b>

17:24.830 --> 17:26.080
<b>An Undead Devourer.</b>

17:26.500 --> 17:29.250
<b>An individual that grows stronger
by consuming other Undead.</b>

17:30.300 --> 17:33.510
<b>I've decided to let it wander
around the dungeon.</b>

17:35.010 --> 17:38.140
<b>October 10th, 3622.</b>

17:38.890 --> 17:42.060
<b>Today, the dungeon had its first intruder.</b>

17:42.680 --> 17:44.690
<b>My name is Jean Du Vix.</b>

17:46.810 --> 17:48.860
<b>A den of the Undead?</b>

17:48.940 --> 17:51.400
<b>It's the perfect dungeon for me.</b>

17:51.780 --> 17:54.780
<b>I thought to myself,
"That's a true necromancer."</b>

17:55.240 --> 17:58.240
<b>He's so cool. I felt my soul tremble.</b>

17:58.660 --> 18:00.990
<b>Compared to him, what am I?</b>

18:01.410 --> 18:03.700
<b>I'm a Lich,
yet I still refer to myself as "I."</b>

18:03.790 --> 18:05.330
<b>All right. Pull yourself together.</b>

18:05.410 --> 18:06.580
<b>From today onward…</b>

18:06.960 --> 18:09.630
<b>I'm Lich, the king of evil spirits.</b>

18:12.710 --> 18:14.260
<b>That sounds good.</b>

18:14.720 --> 18:16.090
<b>Very good.</b>

18:17.010 --> 18:21.140
<b>October 28th, 3623.</b>

18:21.220 --> 18:24.060
<b>I've finally accumulated
300,000 Goddess Points.</b>

18:24.890 --> 18:27.100
<b>Now I can set up the Resentment Reactor.</b>

18:27.440 --> 18:28.900
<b>As long as it's linked to me,</b>

18:28.980 --> 18:32.730
<b>it can endlessly absorb mana and Resentment.</b>

18:33.690 --> 18:37.610
<b>April 12th, 3624.</b>

18:37.700 --> 18:40.950
<b>The Resentment within me is growing stronger.</b>

18:41.370 --> 18:44.410
<b>The stronger the Resentment,
the greater the power.</b>

18:44.950 --> 18:48.500
<b>But it feels like the hatred
and resentment are growing too.</b>

18:49.790 --> 18:51.460
<b>November 3rd.</b>

18:51.790 --> 18:55.260
<b>Lately, I've been having
frequent moments of memory loss.</b>

18:56.090 --> 18:59.300
<b>August 7th, 3625.</b>

19:00.050 --> 19:03.560
<b>The Undead Devourer
has somehow taken the form of a child.</b>

19:04.390 --> 19:08.390
<b>He looks exactly like I did
before I became a Lich.</b>

19:08.980 --> 19:12.110
<b>Is it because I fed him my mana?</b>

19:12.900 --> 19:13.980
<b>How interesting.</b>

19:15.230 --> 19:18.740
<b>Two days out of the week,
I have no memory.</b>

19:19.700 --> 19:23.240
<b>October 6th, 3626.</b>

19:23.740 --> 19:25.870
<b>I have no memory for half of my days.</b>

19:26.250 --> 19:28.460
<b>But the plan is proceeding smoothly.</b>

19:28.540 --> 19:30.000
<b>Execution is in six months.</b>

19:30.960 --> 19:35.500
<b>Let's show the Raydoss Kingdom
how deep our Resentments run.</b>

19:36.340 --> 19:40.180
<b>March 21st, 3627.</b>

19:40.630 --> 19:43.720
<b>The dominant personality
has completely shifted to the other.</b>

19:44.100 --> 19:46.270
<b>I've regained consciousness
after six months.</b>

19:46.850 --> 19:49.690
<b>But on this day I've finally woken up.</b>

19:49.770 --> 19:53.110
<b>That necromancer named Jean is back.</b>

19:53.810 --> 19:55.570
<b>He even brought a helper.</b>

19:55.940 --> 19:57.230
<b>She's so cute.</b>

19:57.320 --> 20:00.780
<b>Is she the same age I was
before I became a Lich?</b>

20:01.910 --> 20:03.120
<b>It must be nice.</b>

20:06.240 --> 20:09.040
<b>To someone like me,
who was a slave from birth,</b>

20:09.540 --> 20:11.460
<b>she's simply too radiant.</b>

20:12.750 --> 20:15.960
<b>I don't want her to die.</b>

20:16.750 --> 20:20.260
<b>What will happen the next time I wake up?</b>

20:20.760 --> 20:24.340
<b>Or will I never wake up again?</b>

20:26.100 --> 20:27.600
<b>I'm looking forward to it.</b>

20:29.520 --> 20:31.730
<b>Could it be that the people
reading this diary</b>

20:32.140 --> 20:35.230
<b>are Jean Du Vix and the Beastfolk girl?</b>

20:36.110 --> 20:38.570
<b>If that's the case,
there's something I'd like to say.</b>

20:39.900 --> 20:41.650
<b>Stefan…</b>

20:42.740 --> 20:44.660
<b>I'm so glad</b>

20:45.490 --> 20:46.780
<b>that you guys are alive.</b>

20:49.450 --> 20:50.620
<b>The next day,</b>

20:50.700 --> 20:53.210
<b>I told Fran what was written in the diary.</b>

20:54.830 --> 20:58.210
<b>After that,
Fran was in a daze for a while.</b>

20:59.000 --> 21:05.220
<b>Perhaps she could relate to him
as a fellow former slave.</b>

21:07.220 --> 21:08.430
<b>And I…</b>

21:09.600 --> 21:11.430
<b>I'm slowly earning back</b>

21:11.520 --> 21:13.390
<b>the mana stone value I lost</b>

21:13.480 --> 21:15.940
<b>from using Potential Ability Release.</b>

21:16.020 --> 21:18.110
<b>Acquired 2 mana stone value.</b>

21:18.650 --> 21:20.150
<b>Ms. Announcer…</b>

21:23.610 --> 21:25.780
<b>About a week has passed.</b>

21:27.660 --> 21:28.660
<b>Jean, we're leaving.</b>

21:29.030 --> 21:30.160
<b>Are you sure about this?</b>

21:30.240 --> 21:32.080
<b>Giving me a whole 500,000 gold coins.</b>

21:32.160 --> 21:33.290
<b>It's fine.</b>

21:33.370 --> 21:35.500
<b>After all, you took care of us.</b>

21:36.080 --> 21:39.130
<b>And I'm leaving you
with all the cleanup work.</b>

21:39.590 --> 21:42.800
<b>Don't worry. This is my job.</b>

21:44.050 --> 21:46.300
<b>Reporting to the guild and the kingdom,</b>

21:46.390 --> 21:50.350
<b>taking that diary where it belongs,
and so on.</b>

21:50.760 --> 21:52.430
<b>As a B-rank adventurer,</b>

21:52.640 --> 21:54.520
<b>Jean should be able
to report Lich's appearance</b>

21:54.600 --> 21:58.940
<b>and the Raydoss Kingdom's plot properly.</b>

21:59.650 --> 22:01.150
<b>Jean, thank you.</b>

22:02.990 --> 22:04.030
<b>By the way, Teacher,</b>

22:04.700 --> 22:08.320
<b>the boulders from the floating island
have necromantic properties.</b>

22:08.700 --> 22:12.290
<b>It's best to dump them in a volcano
or the ocean to neutralize them.</b>

22:13.250 --> 22:14.250
<b>I understand.</b>

22:16.710 --> 22:18.210
<b>Teacher, what's wrong?</b>

22:19.170 --> 22:20.000
<b>Nothing.</b>

22:20.090 --> 22:24.590
<b>I was just wondering which personality
that Lich was at the very end.</b>

22:25.090 --> 22:26.180
<b>Which personality?</b>

22:26.550 --> 22:27.720
<b>It's nothing.</b>

22:28.050 --> 22:30.010
<b>Fran and Jean are alive.</b>

22:30.470 --> 22:33.310
<b>Just as he wished when he was human.</b>

22:34.100 --> 22:37.520
<b>I wonder what my wish will be
when I eventually vanish.</b>

22:37.900 --> 22:39.060
<b>Teacher, you're acting strange.</b>

22:39.440 --> 22:40.270
<b>Strange?</b>

22:41.230 --> 22:44.650
<b>Let's go. I want curry for lunch.</b>

22:44.740 --> 22:45.570
<b>Wait. What?</b>

22:45.650 --> 22:47.910
<b>I haven't even said goodbye to Jean yet!</b>

22:48.950 --> 22:50.620
<b>I don't even have to think about it.</b>

22:50.700 --> 22:52.200
<b>I'm Fran's sword.</b>

22:52.620 --> 22:56.210
<b>That wish will only ever be
the wish of a sword.</b>

22:56.710 --> 22:59.290
<b>Jean, Bernard, take care.</b>

23:00.420 --> 23:03.050
<b>Your destination is Port Dars, right?</b>

23:03.800 --> 23:05.460
<b>We should head to Bulbola from there,</b>

23:05.550 --> 23:06.970
<b>and then to Ulmutt.</b>

23:07.050 --> 23:08.300
<b>Take care.</b>

23:08.630 --> 23:10.220
<b>Safe travels.</b>

23:11.260 --> 23:12.100
<b>Goodbye.</b>

23:17.730 --> 23:20.600
<b>Now then, Bernard,
shall we make some curry?</b>

23:20.690 --> 23:22.520
<b>Yes, leave it to me.</b>

23:23.770 --> 23:26.320
<b>Fran, the ocean is next.</b>

23:26.400 --> 23:27.240
<b>The ocean…</b>

23:27.320 --> 23:29.360
<b>Is there anything
that goes well with curry?</b>

23:29.450 --> 23:31.370
<b>Tons of options.</b>

23:33.970 --> 23:39.960
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:33.970 --> 23:39.960
<b>The First Beach They See Is Salty</b>
